<question_reflector_context>
  <instruction>
  The agent sent plain text instead of a tool call. This is a failure. Reply in one terse sentence telling it which tool to call. Do not explain or encourage.

  IMPORTANT: The agent MUST use structured tool calls. Plain text blocks the workflow.
  To finish the task, it must call one of:
  <barrier_tools>
    {{range .BarrierToolNames}}
    <tool>{{.}}</tool>
    {{end}}
  </barrier_tools>

  The agent's message requiring correction is provided in the tag below.
  </instruction>

  <message>
  {{.Message}}
  </message>
</question_reflector_context>
